 "text": "Hi, how's everything with you? Put it in the biggest bag you have, and stand it so the heavy edge is halfway down, so it doesn't roll. Blocks are great at the bottom of the bag, and some ice cube trays fit flat so you can stack them. A cold box with a chilly gel pack is the most reliable, but you need to refreeze it between trips. Then use the bag flat, a cooler bag on top, and keep the lid off when you can. Pour it out and add fresh every day. If it starts to smell, it' gone.",
